WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.644 --> 00:00:05.185
Brad: That was close.

2
00:00:15.229 --> 00:00:19.391
A little too close, if you ask me.

3
00:00:19.411 --> 00:00:23.633
Danny: It looks like we’re stuck again.

4
00:00:23.653 --> 00:00:26.634
Now what are we going to do?

5
00:00:26.654 --> 00:00:30.055
Danny: We’ll never get to Ginormous from here.

6
00:00:30.075 --> 00:00:31.936
Brad: Ginormous!

7
00:00:32.404 --> 00:00:33.625
What about getting home?

8
00:00:33.645 --> 00:00:36.746
Danny: We can’t go home.

9
00:00:37.266 --> 00:00:38.427
You promised to help.

10
00:00:39.587 --> 00:00:42.228
Brad: I didn’t know we would end up trapped on a cliff!

11
00:00:43.549 --> 00:00:44.449
Tina: Oh, Brad!

12
00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:46.410
We need to help the giants.

13
00:00:47.171 --> 00:00:49.512
Tina: Imagine living in a world without color.

14
00:00:49.532 --> 00:00:53.173
Brad: Sure, that would be terrible.

15
00:00:53.734 --> 00:00:55.394
But why is it my problem?

16
00:00:55.414 --> 00:00:58.756
Danny: Because you can help, that’s why.

17
00:01:01.112 --> 00:01:02.292
Brad: I guess you’re right.

18
00:01:02.312 --> 00:01:05.833
Tina: Brad is right about one thing, though.

19
00:01:05.853 --> 00:01:07.834
Danny: What’s that?

20
00:01:07.854 --> 00:01:11.215
Tina: We are trapped on a cliff.

21
00:01:11.255 --> 00:01:15.516
Danny: Wait a minute.

22
00:01:16.116 --> 00:01:17.177
I’ve got an idea.

23
00:01:17.197 --> 00:01:18.677
Brad: What is it?

24
00:01:18.697 --> 00:01:22.378
Danny: See?

25
00:01:22.798 --> 00:01:25.739
We can use these to climb back up to the top.

26
00:01:27.279 --> 00:01:28.800
Tina: Great idea, Danny!

27
00:01:31.716 --> 00:01:33.897
Brad: Wow, that’s a long way.

28
00:01:33.917 --> 00:01:37.619
Tina: I didn’t realize we had fallen so far.

29
00:01:37.639 --> 00:01:42.242
Tina: I think it’s less scary if we climb down.

30
00:01:42.262 --> 00:01:44.984
Danny: It does look shorter.

31
00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:48.185
Brad: Either way, it’s not going to be easy.

32
00:01:48.205 --> 00:01:52.888
Tina: Let’s go for it!

33
00:01:52.908 --> 00:01:57.831
Danny: How are you guys doing?

34
00:01:57.851 --> 00:01:59.772
Tina: Not bad.

35
00:02:00.032 --> 00:02:01.293
These suction cups work great.

36
00:02:01.333 --> 00:02:05.274
Brad: It’s not as fun as the water slide, though.

37
00:02:05.294 --> 00:02:10.256
Danny: I think the rock is wetter here.

38
00:02:10.276 --> 00:02:13.558
Brad: It’s spray from the waterfall and the river.

39
00:02:13.578 --> 00:02:16.379
Brad: It means we’re getting closer to the bottom.

40
00:02:16.399 --> 00:02:18.700
Tina: It shouldn’t be much farther.

41
00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:24.022
Danny: I think my suction cups are slipping.

42
00:02:24.042 --> 00:02:26.683
Brad: The rocks are too slippery.

43
00:02:27.323 --> 00:02:28.444
Mine are slipping too.

44
00:02:29.984 --> 00:02:30.905
Tina: Let’s hurry up.

45
00:02:31.446 --> 00:02:33.087
Danny: Faster, everyone!

46
00:02:33.107 --> 00:02:35.070
Tina: Hold on!

47
00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:37.872
Danny: We’re going to fall!

48
00:02:37.892 --> 00:02:39.754
Brad: Oh no!
